# Project intentions

Read [docs/INTENTIONS.md](docs/INTENTIONS.md) before expanding scope.

## Stay in v1

Allowed: naive/mean/drift/seasonal naive, SES, Holt, holdout evaluate, MAE/RMSE/MAPE.

Do **not** add without updating INTENTIONS first:

- ARIMA, Prophet, ML models
- Prediction intervals
- Multivariate forecasts
- I/O or plotting (sibling `timeseries-grafana`)
- A forked Series type

## Use the sibling library

Input and output are `timeseries.Series[float64]`. Use the public API only. Local development uses `replace => ../timeseries`.
